{%- comment -%}
  First Access V2: the coming soon page, second direction.

  SEPARATE FROM V1 IN EVERY FILE IT OWNS. Its own template, section,
  snippets, stylesheet and script. The one thing it shares is
  `layout/first-access.liquid`, which it only reads: that layout is
  theme.liquid with the header, footer and cart drawer removed, and V2 wants
  exactly the same absence of store chrome. Reusing it changes nothing about
  V1.

  A .liquid template rather than .json, for the same reason as V1: only a
  .liquid template can choose its layout, and having no navigation is the
  defining property of both pages.

  HIDDEN BY DEFAULT. This template renders only for the page it is assigned
  to. Nothing links here, it is not in any menu, and the share buttons on it
  deliberately point at the public First Access URL rather than at this
  preview. See the `share_url` setting in the section.

  NO EM DASH CHARACTERS. Owner rule for V2.
{%- endcomment -%}
